I defined the campaign checks, product requirements and Account-team workflow, then directed **AI coding agents** to implement and iterate on them. I reviewed the outputs against the reporting task: select the right campaign and dates, inspect results against the objective, explain changes and produce a report a client can check.

That gave me a practical division of work. The agents helped build the software; I specified the marketing rules, checked calculations and report scope, reviewed the interface and revised flows that could run correctly but still support a weak recommendation. The earlier reporting interface below records that starting point.
